    "preamble": "Sk. Abdul Jamir vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 2 August, 2021 In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Blapl No.4624 of 2021 Sk. Abdul Jamir .... Petitioner Mr. B. S. Rayaguru, Advocate -versus- State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Mrs. S. Patnaik, Aga for State Coram: The Chief Justice Order",
    "facts": "Mrs. Patnaik, learned Additional Government Advocate for the State has confirmed this fact and also filed the report dated 2nd August, 2021 of the I.I.C., Jagatpur Police Station, Cuttack, which is taken on record. 5. The charge sheet has been filed. It is seen that the Petitioner was an employee of the principal accused and has been in custody since 17th December, 2020. He has no criminal antecedents. The co-accused is still in custody.",
